<title>RUSSIA: Russia to sell UES stake via convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Russia to sell UES stake via convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia plans to sell a 7.5 percent stake in national power company Unified Energy System (UES) through an issue of convertible bonds, a Russian Privatisation Centre spokeswoman said on Friday.</p>
<p>Terms are to be decided by the managers of the issue, named earlier on Friday, spokeswoman Yelena Shalneva told Reuters.</p>
</text>
